OL,3,GNEWSAStories to make you smile from
OL,4,Aacross Yorkshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvery week in Yorkshire we cover
OL,7,Fuplifting and feel-good stories across
OL,8,Four region - and we like to shout about
OL,9,Fthem.
OL,11,FThis week, we're featuring a stolen
OL,12,Fwedding album finding its way back
OL,13,Fhome, a spare room scheme for
OL,14,Fvulnerable young people and a
OL,15,Fsofa-based Children in Need challenge.
OL,17,FIn 2023, Manasse Kianga was living in
OL,18,FRotherham and playing Sunday league
OL,19,Ffootball when he helped Doncaster side
OL,20,FRossington Main to promotion.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
